{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間ね、風立ちぬを観に行ったのよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/11/0815588/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんと川後とね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリ作品はこれで最後やー宮崎さん駿さん言うもんだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、劇場で私これ観ましたよ。って胸はって言える日くるなこりゃって思って、観ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て思ったことは、飛行機難しすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機って人と夢と希望を乗せて飛ぶ素敵な乗り物で、いまは当たり前のように使われてるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ出来るまでは、みんな頭かかえて工夫に工夫を重ねて何年も何年もこんきよく研究してそれでこの大きな鉄の塊が飛ぶようになったんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ったらなんか昔の人ってすごいなと思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思いながら観てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右手に白ぶどうジュース持って観てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/11/0815588/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの映画は是非教えてほしいものだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できれば、こー...ファンタジーなものとか結構好きだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":